<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - UST Inc cut to neutral.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - UST Inc cut to neutral.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney said analyst Martin Feldman downgraded UST Inc to neutral from outperform.</p>
<p>-- In a report, Feldman cited a UST profit warning issued Tuesday.  He cut his 1997 earnings estimate to $2.64 a share from $2.66 and lowered his 1998 view to $2.88 from $2.93.</p>
</text>
